        "text": "=You are a meeting scribe. Read the whiteboard photo and turn it into clean notes for the meeting \"{{ $json['Meeting title'] }}\". Extract a short summary, the decisions that were made, every action item with its owner and due date when written, and any open questions. If the handwriting is unclear, make your best reading and keep it short.",
