      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 332,
        "height": 708,
        "content": "## 1. Submit the photo\nA built-in n8n form takes the meeting title, attendees and the whiteboard photo. No external service needed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "606298fe-f6e1-4811-bdfa-3735c4a8fb81",
      "name": "S2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        352,
        -288
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 740,
        "height": 708,
        "content": "## 2. AI reads the image (Basic LLM Chain)\nGemini reads the handwriting straight from the photo and returns structured JSON. Unreadable photos trigger an email back to the submitter."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2fcbb39e-d1f9-4415-a9ed-86ea3a33f1d9",
